@startuml
title Request handling
clock "Clock" as C with period 50
binary "Enable" as EN
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU
analog "Load" as L between 0 and 10

WB has "Busy loading" as Processing, Waiting, Idle

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low
L is 1

@100 as :request
WU is Waiting : clicks
WB is Processing
EN is high
L is 8

@300
WB is Waiting
WU is {-}
L is 4

@WU
500 is Idle #palegreen
+100 is {hidden}

@:request+50
WU -> WB : URL

WB@300 -> EN@400 : done
WB@100 <-> @+200 : {200 ms}
@500 <-> @600 : {idle}
highlight 300 to 400 #Gold : Waiting
note bottom of WU : response
@enduml
